        "native_id": "vy906dgn4v86",
        "status": "identified",
        "body": "There was an issue with our billing metrics exporter that caused us to mis-report usage for October at month-end. This is causing October usage to be reported as 0 in our cost management app. We are working to backfill the correct data. \n\nNote that this did not affect billing, and is only a visualization issue.",
